### Dimts REST API Level 2: Complete flows with examples
### Reference implementation at packages/api/src/

### Setup headers and variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/v1
@hostKey = test-host-key-secret
@sessionId = session-test-12345678
@sessionToken = test-session-token-abcdef1234567890

### 1. Create session (web/REST channel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lang": "en",
  "channel": "web",
  "simple": false
}

### 2. Ask a question
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "clientMsgId": "msg-001",
  "lang": "en",
  "text": "What is the first law of thermodynamics?",
  "via": "text",
  "simple": false
}

### 3. Send feedback (helpful)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask/{{msg-001}}/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "helpful": true
}

### 4. Create help request
POST {{baseUrl}}/help
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "includeSummary": true
}

### 5. Check help availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/help/availability?sessionId={{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 6. Get available jobs with accommodation needs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?lang=en&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### 7. Subscribe to job alerts (SMS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "clientRequestId": "sub-001",
  "lang": "en",
  "channel": "sms",
  "contact": "+251911111111",
  "consent": {
    "accepted": true,
    "noticeVersion": "job-alerts-v1"
  }
}

### 8. Get insights (teacher/admin with host key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights?startDate=2026-11-01&endDate=2026-11-13&format=json&minCellSize=5
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dimts-Key: {{hostKey}}

### 9. Export insights as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights?startDate=2026-11-01&endDate=2026-11-13&format=csv&minCellSize=5
X-Dimts-Key: {{hostKey}}

### 10. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 11. Get supported languages
GET {{baseUrl}}/languages

### LTI 1.3 Integration flows

### 12. LTI platform registration (POST /lti/login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lti/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iss": "https://lms.example.com",
  "client_id": "dimts-client-123",
  "login_hint": "learner-456",
  "target_link_uri": "https://app.example.com/lti/launch",
  "lti_message_hint": "context-789"
}

### 13. LTI learner launch (receive id_token, create session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lti/launch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..signature_here",
  "state": "c3RhdGUtYWJjZGVmMTIzNDU2"
}

### 14. LTI instructor launch (same as learner but with Instructor role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lti/launch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..signature_here",
  "state": "c3RhdGUtYWJjZGVmMzQ1Njc4"
}

### 15. Get insights as LTI instructor (using session bearer token from step 14)
@ltiInstructorToken = lti-instructor-token-from-launch
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights?startDate=2026-11-01&endDate=2026-11-13&format=json
Authorization: Bearer {{ltiInstructorToken}}

### 16. Get JWKS public key
GET {{baseUrl}}/lti/jwks
